{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 15:38:53.807606", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Description\\nThe network consists of:\\n- **Hosts**: `pc1` and `pc2`\\n- **Routers**: `router1` and `router2` (running FRRRouting)\\n- **Topology**:\\n  - `router1:eth0` connected to `router2:eth0`\\n  - `router1:eth1` connected to `pc1:eth0`\\n  - `router2:eth1` connected to `pc2:eth0`\\n\\n#### Current State\\nPing reachability tests were conducted between the hosts (`pc1` and `pc2`). The results are as follows:\\n- **Ping from `pc1` to `pc2`**:\\n  - Destination IP: `200.1.1.2`\\n  - Status: **Unknown**\\n  - No data on transmitted packets, received packets, loss percentage, or round-trip time.\\n- **Ping from `pc2` to `pc1`**:\\n  - Destination IP: `195.11.14.2`\\n  - Status: **Unknown**\\n  - No data on transmitted packets, received packets, loss percentage, or round-trip time.\\n\\n#### Observations\\n1. **Reachability Issue**:\\n   - Both hosts (`pc1` and `pc2`) are unable to communicate with each other. The ping tests yielded an \"unknown\" status, indicating a potential connectivity issue.\\n\\n2. **Lack of Diagnostic Data**:\\n   - The ping results do not provide detailed metrics such as packet transmission, reception, or round-trip time. This suggests that the issue might be more fundamental, such as routing misconfigurations or link failures.\\n\\n#### Next Steps\\nTo further diagnose the problem, I will:\\n1. Investigate the BGP configuration and routing tables on `router1` and `router2`.\\n2. Check the network configuration of `pc1` and `pc2` to ensure proper IP settings.\\n3. Verify the link status and interface configurations on all devices.\\n\\nThis report highlights the initial findings and the need for deeper analysis to pinpoint the root cause of the connectivity issue., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='c6a229a9-b4e0-487f-96c2-e25fca8656ab'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
